    historyContent: {
      origins: "Casita Robada is the Argentinean name for this children's fishing game. It's also known as Steal the Old Man's Bundle, Steal the Old Man's Pack, or Steal Pile in English-speaking countries. In Italy it's called Rubamazzo. The game is popular among children for its simple rules and exciting 'stealing' mechanic.",
